    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27087" root="طمر" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُمْرُورٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِمْرٌ</span>: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِمِرٌّ</span>, in two
places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A man (O) <i>possessing nothing:</i>
(O, K:) accord. to IDrd, <i>a low, vile,</i> or <i>mean,
person,</i> [so I render <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَانِصٌ</span>, q. v.,] <i>in evil condition:</i> a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُمْلُولٌ</span>. (O.) And <i>A
stranger.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Dry wood.</i> (O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And
The [<i>bird called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِقِرَّاق</span>. (O, K.)

